{"5045570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Odonata Augmenta: Rogue Dragonfly", "steam_appid": 5045570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where Alien Invaders infiltrated nature and are stealing water from your pond in order to power their Alien Intelligence... You fight them with their own weapons! Defend your habitat and your larvae in the water and <strong>destroy the AI</strong> in this 3D Bullet Heaven!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight Overwhelming Forces</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Aliens are many and all your water are belong to them. Are you ready to fight back with nothing but your dash, sheer willpower and uh... Guns?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5045570/extras/79a11169beadc16ffbaeb1ddea7c0c53.poster.avif?t=1787696651\" width=640 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5045570/extras/79a11169beadc16ffbaeb1ddea7c0c53.webm?t=1787696651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5045570/extras/79a11169beadc16ffbaeb1ddea7c0c53.mp4?t=1787696651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade your Dragonfly</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You gain scraps by defeating enemies. You can choose between different upgrades once you collect enough scraps. Enhance yourself and defeat them at their own battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5045570/extras/a609084a20518460ce580f4c0abfedf3.poster.avif?t=1787696651\" width=640 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item